# Per-role Hiera data directory
# Role-specific data for nodes classified via trusted extensions
#
# Example files:
#   - data/role/web.yaml
#   - data/role/app.yaml
#   - data/role/db.yaml
#
# Roles are set during CSR generation via pp_role extension:
#   puppet agent -t --custom_attributes "pp_role=web"
#
# This directory will be populated as roles are defined in site-modules/role/
